{
  "decision": "stop",
  "rationale": "The budget (200 evals) and round cap (4) have been reached. The Pareto front is well-mapped across the feasible trade-off space: it spans luts_plus_ffs from 1288 to 5899 and accuracy_bits from 13.6 to 24.6, comfortably covering the hypervolume reference point (4000, 12). The front includes designs that satisfy all constraints (throughput >= 32 MSPS, max_abs_err <= 2^-12, sys_p99_batch_us <= 0.44 us). The selection rule (min luts_plus_ffs) points to the pipelined_m design with luts_plus_ffs=1288, which has 13.6 bits of accuracy and 93.6 MSPS throughput, well within the system requirements. No further exploration is possible or needed."
